The Sky Goddess opened her hands, and the wind sprites soared upward, weaving between the stars. As they danced past each light, the stars began to shimmer and twinkle, responding to the sprites' playful movements.

The Sky Goddess laughed with joy. Her stars were no longer frozen—they flickered and pulsed with life, each twinkle a conversation with the dancing winds.

